                                "sense_id": "0bf19c1b-715e-332f-b53c-a98da6e43690",
                                "text": "The prevalence of eumenorrhea among women with PCOS is significantly increased if the Rotterdam diagnostic criteria are applied, because hirsute eumenorrheic women with polycystic ovaries are included."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4253aa2-ab0d-4945-a011-3152ed3e9eba",
                                "sense_id": "0bf19c1b-715e-332f-b53c-a98da6e43690",
                                "text": "In eumenorrhea, menstrual cycles occur at intervals of 25 to 35 days."
                            }
